        "Content": "***Email Enquiries Only***\r\n\r\nLocated in the vibrant heart of Stoneybatter, this spacious four-bedroom, two-bathroom duplex apartment has recently undergone a full refurbishment, including newly renovated bathrooms and a modernised open-plan kitchen.\r\n\r\nThe property combines a fresh, contemporary finish with the established character and feel of a traditional Stoneybatter home. Spread over two floors, it features four well-proportioned bedrooms, two bathrooms and a bright living space leading into a fully equipped open-plan kitchen with ample storage.\r\n\r\nSituated in a quiet residential area yet just minutes from Dublin city centre, the property offers easy access to Stoneybatter’s popular cafés, restaurants, bars and independent shops. Excellent public transport links, including the LUAS, major bus routes and Smithfield, are all within walking distance."
